+# Aegis Carbon Awareness — Overview & Usage
+
+This patch implements initial carbon-awareness features:
+
+- Instrument training and inference with CodeCarbon to estimate emissions (services/training/train_with_carbon.py, services/inference/inference_emissions_wrapper.py). Emissions are logged to MLflow, MCP and pushed to Prometheus pushgateway.
+- Carbon-aware scheduler that submits queued Argo training workflows when carbon intensity is below a configurable threshold (services/carbon/carbon_scheduler.py). Scheduler reads YAML workflows from CARBON_QUEUE_DIR and submits them via kubectl.
+- Promotion guard extended to consider emissions (services/promotion/check_and_promote_carbon.py). Promotion can be blocked or require A2A if emissions exceed configured budgets or if accuracy gain per kgCO2e is too low.
+- Argo training workflow annotated with carbon hints (k8s/argo/training-workflow-carbon.yaml).
+- Prometheus alerting rules and Grafana dashboard examples for carbon and efficiency monitoring (k8s/monitoring/prometheusrule-carbon.yaml, grafana/carbon_dashboard.json).
+
+Operator notes
+- Install CodeCarbon in your trainer/inference environments (pip install codecarbon).
+- Configure env vars: MLFLOW_TRACKING_URI, PROM_PUSHGATEWAY, AEGIS_MCP, CARBON_API_URL (optional), CARBON_THRESHOLD, CARBON_QUEUE_DIR.
+- Queue Argo workflow YAMLs in CARBON_QUEUE_DIR to have the carbon_scheduler submit them when carbon intensity is low.
+- Tune MIN_GAIN_PER_KG and MAX_EMISSIONS_PER_PROMOTION in check_and_promote_carbon.py to reflect organizational carbon policy.
+- Use cloud provider carbon APIs or ElectricityMap as CARBON_API_URL for real signals. The scheduler has a stub mode for local testing.
+- Add Prometheus metrics exporters and scrape pushgateway metrics; import the Grafana dashboard.
+
+Limitations & next steps
+- CodeCarbon provides estimates; for exact measurements integrate rack/PDUs or cloud provider carbon APIs.
+- Consider integrating a Kubernetes scheduler plugin for carbon-aware node selection for fine-grained placement.
+- Integrate spot/renewable instance selection via cluster autoscaler hooks and Argo nodeSelectors/affinity.
+
